    "mathformer.execute_details": {
      "command": [
        "{python}",
        "tests/test_program/run_comprehensive_tests.py",
        "--module-family",
        "environment",
        "--json"
      ],
      "subprocess_timeout_seconds": 900,
      "boundary": "Required paths are checked before execution; dry-run returns without launching. Native subprocess output capture and filesystem auditing remain inside execute. Timeout, nonzero exit, and undeclared writes fail the child; no retries.",
      "downstream": "run selects environment rows from tests/test_matrix.json in matrix order. State retains matrix, selected, families, index and results; index increments once per row until len(selected), including after ordinary check failure. Individual timeouts become failed results. Current dependency-map and lock checks have 120s and 30s limits; absent optional uv skips under default workstation. Finalization validates results, computes status/capability summaries, writes dependency snapshot and report, and exits 0 on success or 3 on failure. Dependency-map-only invocation writes its snapshot report and returns early. Unexpected exceptions propagate; no downstream loop bound is invented here."
